01:32:42.090 --> 01:32:55.150
<i>The air looks thinner than usual,
as if it was fake</i>

01:32:55.770 --> 01:33:02.910
<i>My sick heart always gets wet
under the never stopping rain</i>

01:33:02.910 --> 01:33:10.790
<i>I never have an umbrella with me,
What am I trying to do that anxious?</i>

01:33:24.600 --> 01:33:37.820
<i>I want to hurry back to you,
but the time we promised has already passed</i>

01:33:38.450 --> 01:33:45.590
<i>I wish I could fly out,
do whatever I want, to scatter around</i>

01:33:45.590 --> 01:33:51.150
<i>But I feel like I can't change</i>

01:33:54.220 --> 01:33:58.040
<i>Well they keep on tellin’ me</i>

01:33:59.600 --> 01:34:05.550
<i>At least let me love you</i>

01:34:06.180 --> 01:34:07.600
<i>However</i>

01:34:07.970 --> 01:34:19.510
<i>I want to love, but I can't
I don't want to endure it every day</i>

01:34:20.410 --> 01:34:21.510
<i>Just do it</i>

01:34:22.020 --> 01:34:29.010
<i>It doesn't matter how many times,
It doesn't matter how many times
I turn the pages of my notebook</i>

01:34:29.080 --> 01:34:38.000
<i>Let's start over in fresh place
In our new world</i>

01:34:38.000 --> 01:34:50.350
<i>Some day I will reach you too,
I'll keep this wish</i>

01:35:04.320 --> 01:35:10.990
<i>I'm just walking brave like an idiot
While I don't even have a cape</i>

01:35:11.240 --> 01:35:18.080
<i>You laughed out loud,
But suddenly that's all I needed</i>

01:35:19.820 --> 01:35:23.460
<i>When the sky comes fallin’ down</i>

01:35:24.990 --> 01:35:31.600
<i>From a deep, long hole</i>

01:35:31.760 --> 01:35:40.270
<i>I want to touch your love
But it all changed</i>

01:35:40.350 --> 01:35:47.300
<i>Why I can't go back anymore?</i>

01:35:47.300 --> 01:35:54.390
<i>Why am I relived, why am I not crying?</i>

01:35:54.440 --> 01:36:01.720
<i>Laugh and hug each other, even now</i>

01:36:01.720 --> 01:36:13.610
<i>I want to meet you,
I want to meet you,
Talk even without voice</i>

01:36:14.220 --> 01:36:15.720
<i>I love you</i>

01:36:15.720 --> 01:36:22.880
<i>I don't care how many times,
I don't care how many times
It's not perfect, give us a bouquet of flowers</i>

01:36:22.880 --> 01:36:29.780
<i>Fill up the whole world with that scent</i>

01:36:29.780 --> 01:36:37.080
<i>The stars painting the sky with different colours,
never leaving the night sky black</i>

01:36:37.080 --> 01:36:45.920
<i>Light up to break,
Reapint it to pure white once again</i>

01:36:45.920 --> 01:36:58.730
<i>In that new world,
Let's hold hands every day</i>

01:37:12.800 --> 01:37:19.080
<i>Doesn't matter how many times,
Doesn't matter how many times</i>

01:37:19.080 --> 01:37:27.050
<i>Always, my hand
And your hand</i>
